WEBVTT

00:00:02.982 --> 00:00:14.982
The rim has 48 grip grooves. Again draw only one: a Ø2.4 circle on XY, centre on the horizontal axis, 52.6 from the centre

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:35.356
Half the circle lies outside the rim: cut through, it leaves a half-round groove

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:49.870
Polar pattern: 48 occurrences

00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:59.400
One groove becomes 48, every 7.5°. Two patterns, and the handwheel matches the one in the machine
